  m_Text: "PARTY BOTS\n\nGame Design & Programming:\nFederico Duran\n\n3D Models:\n\"Player
    Robot\" by Gabriel Guerrero\n\"Low Poly Weapons\" by SICS Games (Unity Asset
    Store)\n\"Low-Poly Simple Nature\" by JustCreate (Unity Asset Store)\n\"Skybox
    Extended Shader\" by BOXOPHOBIC (Unity Asset Store)\n\"Stylized Hammer\" by 
    MASH Virtual (Unity Asset Store)\n\"Cartoon Car\" by Marco Siino (Unity Asset
    Store)\n\"Cartoon Toyland\" by Terresquall (Unity Asset Store)\n\"9t5 Low Poly
    Playground\" by 9t5 (Unity Asset Store)\n\"Pinky UI\" by LILA Design (Unity Asset
    Store)\n\"Hyper Casual FX\" by Lana Studio (Unity Asset Store)\n\"Exercise Book\"
    by Nat (Sketchfab)\n\"colgate toothpaste tube\" by Starkster (Sketchfab)\n\"Small
    Low-Poly School Set\" by KirSolo (Sketchfab)\n\"Low Poly Colorful Camera\" by
    maulanafx (Sketchfab)\n\"Battery Low Poly\" by Ele.G (Sketchfab)\n\"SanDisk SD
    Card\" by Kiran Kumar (Sketchfab)\n\n\nSound Design:\nAudio Editing & Integration
    by Federico Duran\nSound Effects via Freesound.org\n\nMusic:\nOriginal Soundtrack
    generated with Suno AI\n\nUser Interface:\nFederico Duran\nKenney Assets\n\nQA:\nFederico
    Duran\n\nSpecial thanks to Jules\u2764\uFE0F\n\nPowered by:\nUnity Engine\n\nThank
    you for playing!\n"
